In-Reply-To: <EA09C4B2B0F16E44B8F3311629493C0D02ED4E3D@DJFPOST01.djf.agrsci.dk>
Message-ID: <8975119BCD0AC5419D61A9CF1A923E9503E2E6EC@iahce2ksrv1.iah.bbsrc.ac.uk>

Hi

RG$weights is a matrix of values, as is RG$R, RG$G etc etc
With

RG[RG$weights>0.1,]

You are filtering RG by it's rows, using a whole matrix to subset it!

If you want to subset on the first column of weights, try:

RG[RG$weights[,1]>0.1,]

Mick 

